Challenge accepted. Hold your object firmly in mind and don't change it.

**Question 1 of 20:** Is it a living thing, or something that was once alive?

{"a2uiMeta":{"note":"Alive or once alive, noted. Question 2 of 20: is it an animal (including humans)?","target":{"surfaceId":"hud-1"},"ask":{"surfaceId":"ask-2"}}}

Alive or once alive, so I can rule out rocks, gadgets and anything else that was never alive.

**Question 2 of 20:** Is it an animal (humans included)?
